@startuml
title Ack Failure And Redelivery Recovery - Explicit Stored Enum / Decision Enum

' 状态图保持默认黑白，不引入模块颜色。

legend right
  代码枚举节点直接显示真实来源：枚举类.枚举值
  示例：ConsumeDecision.ACK / SendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR
  LOGICAL = 查询、时间、次数、配置推导，代码枚举中不存在
  RUNTIME = 执行过程节点，代码枚举中不存在
  ACTION = repository / adapter 动作，不是状态枚举
  PROVIDER ACTION = Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ 原生确认动作
  PROVIDER CAUSE = Provider 原生返回或异常，不是统一状态枚举
  MESSAGE SEMANTIC = message-component 语义，目前不是持久化枚举
endlegend

state "FIRST_DELIVERY\nRUNTIME\nBroker delivers message first time" as R_FIRST_DELIVERY
state "ACQUIRED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.ACQUIRED" as A_ACQUIRED
state "PROCESSING\nIdempotencyStatus.PROCESSING" as DB_PROCESSING
state "TRANSACTION_RUNNING\nRUNTIME\nbusiness + markSuccess transaction" as R_TX_RUNNING
state "BUSINESS_DONE\nRUNTIME\nhandler returns ACK" as R_BUSINESS_DONE
state "SUCCESS\nIdempotencyStatus.SUCCESS" as DB_SUCCESS
state "TRANSACTION_COMMITTED\nRUNTIME\nlocal transaction committed" as R_TX_COMMITTED
state "ACK\nConsumeDecision.ACK" as D_ACK
state "PROVIDER_ACKING\nPROVIDER ACTION\nKafka commit / Pulsar ack / RocketMQ success" as P_ACKING
state "ACK_SUCCESS\nRUNTIME\nBroker confirmation success" as R_ACK_SUCCESS
state "ACK_FAILED\nRUNTIME\ncommit/ack failed or app crashed before returning" as R_ACK_FAILED
state "BROKER_REDELIVERS\nRUNTIME\nmessage remains unconfirmed" as R_BROKER_REDELIVERS
state "SECOND_DELIVERY\nRUNTIME\nBroker delivers same message again" as R_SECOND_DELIVERY
state "DUPLICATE_SUCCESS\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.DUPLICATE_SUCCESS" as A_DUP_SUCCESS
state "SKIP_HANDLER\nRUNTIME\nhandler is not invoked" as R_SKIP_HANDLER
state "ACK_AGAIN\nConsumeDecision.ACK" as D_ACK_AGAIN
state "PROVIDER_ACKING_AGAIN\nPROVIDER ACTION\nconfirm same broker message again" as P_ACKING_AGAIN
state "COMPLETED\nRUNTIME\nconsume completed" as R_COMPLETED

[*] --> R_FIRST_DELIVERY
R_FIRST_DELIVERY --> A_ACQUIRED : acquire(...)
A_ACQUIRED --> DB_PROCESSING : status=PROCESSING, ownerToken=current
DB_PROCESSING --> R_TX_RUNNING
R_TX_RUNNING --> R_BUSINESS_DONE
R_BUSINESS_DONE --> DB_SUCCESS : markSuccess(ownerToken)
DB_SUCCESS --> R_TX_COMMITTED
R_TX_COMMITTED --> D_ACK
D_ACK --> P_ACKING
P_ACKING --> R_ACK_SUCCESS
R_ACK_SUCCESS --> R_COMPLETED
R_COMPLETED --> [*]

P_ACKING --> R_ACK_FAILED
R_ACK_FAILED --> R_BROKER_REDELIVERS
R_BROKER_REDELIVERS --> R_SECOND_DELIVERY
R_SECOND_DELIVERY --> A_DUP_SUCCESS : acquire(...)
A_DUP_SUCCESS --> R_SKIP_HANDLER
R_SKIP_HANDLER --> D_ACK_AGAIN
D_ACK_AGAIN --> P_ACKING_AGAIN
P_ACKING_AGAIN --> R_COMPLETED

note right of DB_SUCCESS
  SUCCESS 是真实持久状态枚举：IdempotencyStatus.SUCCESS。
  它已经在本地事务内落地，所以 ACK 失败后重投不会重新执行业务。
end note

note right of R_ACK_FAILED
  ACK_FAILED 是恢复演进节点，不是代码枚举。
  它只表示 Broker 仍可能重投。
end note
@enduml
